      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"On Fourth Street, the orphan children play on the jungle gym",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Little Timmy broke his arm again on the monkey bars",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Johnny's dad got a nicer car than all the other kids",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"He becomes the alpha and picks on everybody else",
          "rhyme":"yls",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Max protects Claire from all the bullies",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Claire always wish she was as pretty as Julie",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"The boys always chase Julie around the sandbox",
          "rhyme":"Oks",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Claire just waits ’til she gets picked up by her grandpa",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"All of this before the brainwash starts",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Before they get polluted, start thinkin' like adults",
          "rhyme":"Olt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Life is fantasy and somersaults then",
          "rhyme":"En",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Before the world tear apart imagination",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Before there were rules, before there were limits",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Your only enemies were (Br-Brussels sprouts and spinach)",
          "rhyme":"eR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Me, I used to want to be a wizard, when did life get so serious?",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Whatever happened to apple juice and cartwheels?",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
